第一章 Java基础语法
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="expected_hours"

3
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="constraints"

包含实例代码和练习题
--WebAppBoundary--

### 14. 根据选定题目生成自测练习 - POST /rag/generate_selected_student_exercise
### 前端发送基于选定题目的自测练习生成请求 (需要正确的字段格式)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/ai/rag/generate_selected_student_exercise
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "selected_questions": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "content": "Java中int类型的取值范围是？",
      "type": "选择题",
      "difficulty": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "content": "什么是面向对象编程？",
      "type": "问答题",
      "difficulty": "medium"
    }
  ],
  "requirements": "基于这些题目生成相似的练习题",
  "knowledge_preferences": "Java面向对象编程"
}

